			(property "Description" "MEAN WELL HRP-300-24 enclosed AC/DC PSU 24V 14A 336W, PFC. Screw terminals 1-7: 1=AC/L 2=AC/N 3=FG 4,5=-V 6,7=+V. Signal connector CN100 (HRS DF11-8): pin3=DC-OK, 5=GND, 7=+S, 8=-S (pins 1,2,4,6 = NC, omitted). Pin numbers CNx = CN100 pin x."
				(at 0 0 0)
