		(property "Description" "DFRobot DFR0601 dual-channel DC motor driver, 6.5-37V motor supply, 12A continuous per channel (70A/100ms peak), 3-5V logic, PWM 18-60kHz. Truth table per channel: INA L/INB L = stop; L/H = forward (PWM on Mx_A); H/L = reverse (PWM on Mx_B); H/H = floating. Inputs read HIGH when left floating. Pins 1-16 follow the DFRobot datasheet table; the datasheet lists pin 10 as 'X' (described as Ground) - treated as GND. Pins 17-19 are status LEDs (not electrical pins). Logic VCC pins 1 and 6 and GND pins 5 and 10 are duplicated on the board."
			(at 170.18 45.72 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
